  },
  "limits": [
    "One captured attention component on 16 GB hardware, with four measured calls per route, is not fresh-pixel throughput, complete input-to-pose latency, trajectory, endurance or physical8GB validation.",
    "The single-owner gate is not a speed benchmark. Compare paired N3 routes within their own run; no cross-trial or statistically significant speedup is claimed.",
    "No new graph, learned model, original layer/token omission or checkpoint is introduced. Original-model and repository licenses remain separate; see MODEL_LICENSES.md."
  ],
